WEBVTT

00:00:09.790 --> 00:00:15.620
A checklist: tick boxes, items, notes - nested three levels deep. Tick a parent and its children follow.

00:00:15.620 --> 00:00:20.070
Right-click a checklist for what it needs: add, tick, indent or remove an item - and reminders.

00:00:20.070 --> 00:00:25.510
Create a reminder on the whole checklist, on one item, or on any sentence. One already set? Manage it from the same menu.

00:00:25.510 --> 00:00:34.970
After a period, at an exact time, or recurring. The reminder stays with the text, even when it moves.

00:00:34.970 --> 00:00:46.400
Two clicks to set it, one to get back to it: right-click the item again - Manage item reminder.

00:00:46.400 --> 00:01:06.020
Any sentence can carry a reminder: select it, right-click, Create reminder.

00:01:06.020 --> 00:01:13.570
The to-do list in the header shows every reminder - overdue first, then what is due next.

00:01:13.570 --> 00:01:20.260
The Dashboard: structure, storage and backup, events - and every open to-do with its due date.

00:01:20.260 --> 00:01:27.890
Reminders fire on time - even while EasyNotes sits in the tray. One is due in a moment.

00:01:27.890 --> 00:01:33.233
The pop-up names the reminder and the page. Snooze it, or mark it complete - the page is one click away.

